[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_018d8bc7fcbf0550\",\"r_94e2975552159b63\"],null,null,[[\"rc_8d04f70afb3d3a56\",[\"Here is the breakdown of why `luuquangvu` responded the way he did, and where the 20-second vs. 120-second discrepancy comes from:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. Who is `luuquangvu` and why does he think it's 120s / 450s?\\n`luuquangvu` is the core contributor who authored the streaming performance, zombie stream retry logic, and extended thinking pull requests (PR #220, PR #237, PR #310) in `HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API`. \\n\\nIn his implementation of the streaming retry and watchdog lifecycle:\\n* **Default overall request / session stream timeout:** 450s.\\n* **Default stream watchdog / zombie stall timeout:** 120s.\\n\\nBecause he authored those numbers, in his mind the watchdog is hardcoded or defaulted to wait **120 seconds** before deciding a stream has stalled. When he saw your log:\\n```\\n[Watchdog] Socket idle for 20s. Refreshing connection...\\n```\\nhe immediately assumed:\\n\\u003e *\\\"Wait, if my watchdog default is 120s, why on earth did your socket abort after only 20 seconds? You must have passed a 20s watchdog setting or broken configuration.\\\"*\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. If you didn't customize any timers, where did 20s come from?\\nIn `gemini_webapi`, there are two separate timeouts interacting:\\n1. **The HTTP / transport timeout:** Default client initialization (`client.init(...)` or CLI defaults) frequently sets short connection/read timeouts (e\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://en.wikipedia.org/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Watchdog_timer\",null,null,[1791164519]]]],[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://pypi.org/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://pypi.org/project/python-gemini-api/1.0.4/\",\"python-gemini-api 1.0.4 - PyPI\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://github.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://github.com/HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API\",\"GitHub - HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API: Reverse-engineered Python\",null,[]],[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://sourceforge.net/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/gemini-api.mirror/\",\"Gemini-API download | SourceForge.net\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://pypi.org/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://pypi.org/project/python-gemini-api/\",\"python-gemini-api - PyPI\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://github.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://github.com/HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API/issues/6\",\"__Secure-1PSIDTS · Issue #6 · HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API - GitHub\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://github.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://github.com/HanaokaYuzu/Gemini-API/blob/master/README.md\",\"Gemini-API/README.md at master - GitHub\",null,[]],[\"http